    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 2200,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Multi-agent newsletter editorial system\nFive explicit roles share a versioned brief and structured contracts. The workflow has no external send or schedule tool. A failing draft is revised once in this learner build, then escalated for human review."
      },
